# Build-time Firestore export (free content only) — derived, regenerate with
# `npm run export-content`. Firestore is the single content source (locked);
# content is never duplicated in this repo. `content` and `.leakcheck` are
# symlinks that resolve through .export/current (M1-S6 atomic publish); the
# generation store `.export/` holds the actual trees. All derived, never
# committed. Patterns are root-anchored with NO trailing slash so they match
# the symlinks (files), not only directories.
/content
/.leakcheck
/.export

# Superseded static scaffold moved here from the app repo (10 Jul cleanup).
# Kept on disk for the README step-5 consolidation, but NEVER committed:
# every push to main is a production deploy, and these skeleton pages must
# not go live at arnready.com.
legacy-app-scaffold/
